WEBVTT

00:02:59.133 --> 00:03:01.260
it's been proven to a fare-thee-well.

00:03:02.011 --> 00:03:04.055
And as a consequence,

00:03:04.055 --> 00:03:08.809
our political decision-making
process in key countries

00:03:08.809 --> 00:03:11.646
is locked, paralyzed.

00:03:11.646 --> 00:03:16.609
So the political will necessary
to break through this

00:03:16.651 --> 00:03:19.445
has to be expressed
in a much more effective way.

00:03:19.487 --> 00:03:23.324
We are nearing a political event horizon.

00:03:24.283 --> 00:03:30.998
And in the United States,
JP Morgan Chase, Citi, Wells Fargo ...